DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261021T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261021T214500
UID:7558779715699ad8c8181cd6@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:This course explores one of the most important questions of ou
 r time: how can we be who we really are\, while living harmoniously with o
 thers and contributing to something bigger than ourselves?
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/the-individual-and-the-s
 piritual-community-21-oct-2026
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Introduction to Buddhism & Meditation Course
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261102T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261102T214500
UID:96cecf33132131e629bf6305@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:This six-week course on Monday evenings will introduce you to 
 key Buddhist principles and two meditation practices that cultivate self-a
 wareness\, open-heartedness\, and insight.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/introduction-to-buddhism
 -meditation-course-nov-26
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mindful Recovery Course
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261109T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261109T213000
UID:5f5f13b0123699df7af2662d@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:This 6-week Mindfulness based Addiction Recovery programme has
  helped hundreds of people free themselves of unhealthy habits. Whether th
 is is a cycle of workaholism\, sugar cravings\, or you need a digital brea
 k but can’t stop checking your phone\; Mindful Recovery will help free y
 ou from unhelpful patterns of behaviour.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mindful-recovery-nov-202
 6
END:VEVENT
